From e4bf75f33add1891cca3124d57d9e1ca3116dab0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Parimalarengan Gururajan <gururaja@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 09:15:02 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] dpp_local_onboarding - 11bi changes - onboarding_issues

Re-trigger DPP 1905-security onboarding when the backhaul connection
type switches between wired and wireless at runtime: clear stale
peer_1905_security state and the dpp_1905_credentials latch, and reset
DppAgentTask's wired session so a fresh Auth Request isn't rejected as
a duplicate after a wired/wireless round trip. Generalize the
controller's stale-agent cleanup to also cover agents secured via the
wireless bSTA path before their first wired chirp. Add Wi-Fi Easy
Connect 11bi WSC attribute support and related BPL/UCI wifi config
handling.

Signed-off-by: Parimalarengan Gururajan <gururaja@qti.qualcomm.com>
